# API Idempotency and Retries

- Require `Idempotency-Key` on costly/non-idempotent POSTs (payments, creates); replay stored responses on retry.
- Same key + different body → `409`; scope keys by tenant/client; document TTL.
- Retry only transient failures; exponential backoff **+ jitter**; honor `Retry-After` when present.
- Always set outbound timeouts; use circuit breakers on unstable dependencies.
- Do not generate a new idempotency key when retrying the same logical operation.
